        "value": "<p data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"323\"><strong data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"321\">Findings:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"711\">\n<li data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"372\">\n<p data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"372\"><strong data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"341\">Heart Rate:</strong> 76 bpm (within normal range)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"417\">\n<p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"417\"><strong data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"386\">Rhythm:</strong> Regular, Normal Sinus Rhythm</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"461\">\n<p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"461\"><strong data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"432\">P Waves:</strong> Normal, upright in lead II</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"514\">\n<p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"514\"><strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"480\">PR Interval:</strong> 0.16 sec (within normal limits)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"581\">\n<p data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"581\"><strong data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"533\">QRS Complex:</strong> Normal duration (0.08 sec), normal morphology</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"613\">\n<p data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"613\"><strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"599\">ST Segment:</strong> Isoelectric</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"648\">\n<p data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"648\"><strong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"628\">T Waves:</strong> Normal morphology</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"690\">\n<p data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"690\"><strong data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"667\">QT Interval:</strong> Within normal limits</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"711\">\n<p data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"711\"><strong data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"702\">Axis:</strong> Normal</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"739\"><strong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"737\">Impression:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"817\">Normal ECG. No evidence of arrhythmia, ischemia, or conduction abnormality.</p>",
